$$MN=|z_{2}-z_{1}|=|(-3\sqrt{3}-1-\left(4+\sqrt{3}\right)i)-(-7i)|=|-3\sqrt{3}-1+\left(3-\sqrt{3}\right)i|=\sqrt{\left(-3\sqrt{3}-1\right)^{2}+\left(3-\sqrt{3}\right)^{2}}=\sqrt{40}=2\sqrt{10}$$

