$$PQ=|z_{Q}-z_{P}|=|(5-2i)-(2-\left(3\sqrt{3}+2\right)i)|=|3+3i\sqrt{3}|=\sqrt{3^{2}+\left(3\sqrt{3}\right)^{2}}=\sqrt{36}=6$$

