$$PR=|z_{R}-z_{P}|=|(3+2\sqrt{3}+\left(4-2\sqrt{3}\right)i)-(5+6i)|=|-2+2\sqrt{3}-\left(2\sqrt{3}+2\right)i|=\sqrt{\left(-2+2\sqrt{3}\right)^{2}+\left(-2\sqrt{3}-2\right)^{2}}=\sqrt{32}=4\sqrt{2}$$
